\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1.  Wonderful things that we do see
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  In the word of the Almighty,
\par  It is the good works of the saints
\par  and it is done by believers.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  By faith they had their victory
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  that brought the light from the heavens,
\par that brought the strong men also down
\par and even wrestled with the Lord.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  It also brought the dead alive;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And even so, healed all sickness:
\par The first of the truth and of hope
\par Make us to have a great surprise.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.  All little things we don't value
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 is what we use to test our faith.
\par If one is a true believer
\par His soul shall have eternal life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  Faith brings us life from the heavens
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 and drives away the power of death.
\par Our Lord is then the victorious
\par and victory shall be ours always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Jesus, you are my only hope
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 So come and help me in the fight
\par give to me your eternal strength,
\par \pard       that I shall work by faith in you.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

